36\",\"hi\":\"अनुच्छेद 136\"},\"B\":{\"en\":\"Article 129\",\"hi\":\"अनुच्छेद 129\"},\"C\":{\"en\":\"Article 143\",\"hi\":\"अनुच्छेद 143\"},\"D\":{\"en\":\"Article 214\",\"hi\":\"अनुच्छेद 214\"}},\"difficulty\":\"intermediate\",\"source\":\"QuestionWale Original | Verified: Sources — Government of India, Legislative Department, Constitution of India (as on 1 May 2026), Article 136(1)-(2). Direct official document: Legislative Department, Constitution of India as on 1 May 2026 (official PDF: https://www.legislative.gov.in/static/uploads/2025/07/76b9f1c47176fc65accc160f19c982b7.pdf).\",\"source_metadata\":null,\"year\":null,\"pyq_exam_name\":null,\"exam_tags\":[\"SSC\",\"STATE_ONEDAY\",\"STATE_PCS\",\"UPSC\"],\"attempt_count\":0,\"correct_count\":0},{\"id\":\"fd526ef8-5420-4187-9745-33379543dde4\",\"question_text\":{\"en\":\"Consider the following statements: 1. The Preamble mentions social, economic and political justice. 2. Article 38(1) repeats these dimensions. 3. Article 37 makes every Directive Principle directly enforceable by a court. Which are correct?\",\"hi\":\"निम्नलिखित कथनों पर विचार कीजिए: 1. उद्देशिका (प्रस्तावना) सामाजिक, आर्थिक और राजनीतिक न्याय का उल्लेख करती है। 2. अनुच्छेद 38(1) न्याय के इन्हीं आयामों को दोहराता है। 3. अनुच्छेद 37 प्रत्येक राज्य की नीति के निदेशक तत्व को न्यायालय द्वारा प्रत्यक्षतः प्रवर्तनीय बनाता है। उपर्युक्त में से कौन-से कथन सही हैं?\"},\"options\":{\"A\":{\"en\":\"1 only\",\"hi\":\"केवल 1\"},\"B\":{\"en\":\"2 and 3 only\",\"hi\":\"केवल 2 और 3\"},\"C\":{\"en\":\"1 and 2 only\",\"hi\":\"केवल 1 और 2\"},\"D\":{\"en\":\"1, 2 and 3\",\"hi\":\"1, 2 और 3\"}},\"difficulty\":\"advanced\",\"source\":\"QuestionWale Original | Verified v2026-07-16: Constitution of India; NCERT Class IX and XI; NIOS and Supreme Court official documents where applicable.\",\"source_metadata\":{\"primary_sources\":[{\"title\":\"The Constitution of India (Hindi-English diglot edition, as on 1 May 2026)\",\"institution\":\"Legislative Department, Ministry of 